```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START([START PROGRAM]) --> INIT[Initialize Menu\n12 Food Items]
    INIT --> WELCOME[Display Welcome Message]
    WELCOME --> MENU[Display Main Menu]
    MENU --> INPUT[Get User Choice\n1-6 with Validation]

    INPUT --> VALID{Valid Choice?}
    VALID -->|No| ERROR[Show Error: Invalid Choice]
    ERROR --> MENU
    VALID -->|Yes| SWITCH{Switch Choice}

    SWITCH -->|1| DISPLAY[Display Food Menu\nLoop through all items\nPrint formatted table]
    SWITCH -->|2| SEARCH[Search Food Item\nGet Food ID\nFind Index\nIf found: Show details\nElse: Error]
    SWITCH -->|3| ORDER[Place Order\nShow available items\nLoop: Get ID & Qty\nValidate ID, Stock, Qty\nAdd/Update Order Array\nAsk Continue?]
    SWITCH -->|4| BILL[Generate Bill\nIf empty: Error\nPrint itemized receipt\nCalc Grand Total\nConfirm Order?\nIf YES: Deduct Stock\nShow Updated Stock\nClear Orders\nIf NO: Keep Cart]
    SWITCH -->|5| STOCK[View Available Stock\nLoop all items\nPrint ID, Name, Price, Qty\nStatus: In Stock/Out]
    SWITCH -->|6| EXIT[Print Thank You Message\nExit Program]

    DISPLAY --> MENU
    SEARCH --> MENU
    ORDER --> MENU
    BILL --> MENU
    STOCK --> MENU
    EXIT --> END([END PROGRAM])

    style START fill:#e1f5fe
    style END fill:#ffcdd2
    style INIT fill:#fff3e0
    style MENU fill:#f3e5f5
    style INPUT fill:#e8f5e9
    style VALID fill:#fff9c4
    style ERROR fill:#ffcdd2
    style DISPLAY fill:#e3f2fd
    style SEARCH fill:#e3f2fd
    style ORDER fill:#e3f2fd
    style BILL fill:#e3f2fd
    style STOCK fill:#e3f2fd
    style EXIT fill:#ffcdd2
